oto to have a location, either specified manually through the admin form or automatically imported from the file's EXIF metadata. There are future plans to make it suitable for less specific use cases.","topics":[],"score":243852,"global_rank":74072,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":13399},{"name":"sangyh/discrete-event-simulation","owner":"sangyh","html_url":"https://github.com/sangyh/discrete-event-simulation","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Discrete event simulation of shuttle  bus service using a Future Event List (priority queue), as part of Modelling and Simulation course project at Georgia Tech in Spring 2018","topics":[],"score":243850,"global_rank":74074,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":13400}]